신명조;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">투고자격 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">박사학위 소지자 및 교육기관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">교육행정 기관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">연구기관에 연구 활동을 하고 있는 <span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">석사이상의 학위 소지자</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 110%; margin-right: 5pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조;\">논문주제 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 한양신명조